        <mxCell id="6xhOgUXmBeDggfyYtSyj-10" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;roundedPerimeter=1;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;NGR&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;skill-step query&quot; style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px; padding: 4px 8px; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(74, 158, 255, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid rgb(74, 158, 255); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;1. Query 90-day daily NGR per market (13 markets)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;skill-step query&quot; style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px; padding: 4px 8px; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(74, 158, 255, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid rgb(74, 158, 255); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;2. Query tier/provider/promo breakdown&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;arrow&quot; style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;↓&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;skill-step decision&quot; style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px; padding: 4px 8px; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.15); border-left: 3px solid rgb(255, 152, 0); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;3. Fit baseline (IQR + Z-score + MAD)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;skill-step decision&quot; style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px; padding: 4px 8px; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.15); border-left: 3px solid rgb(255, 152, 0); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;4. Is today an anomaly? (IQR outlier OR |z| &amp;gt; 1.5)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;arrow&quot; style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;↓&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flow-row&quot; style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;skill-step action&quot; style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px; padding: 4px 8px; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid rgb(76, 175, 80); flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 80px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;NO → ✅ Normal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;skill-step action&quot; style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px; padding: 4px 8px; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid rgb(76, 175, 80); flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 80px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;YES → Drill down&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;arrow&quot; style=&quot;margin: 2px 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;↓ (if anomaly)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;skill-step query&quot; style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px; padding: 4px 8px; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(74, 158, 255, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid rgb(74, 158, 255); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;5a. Split by VIP tier → which tier moved?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;